# .cursorrules — Cursor Editor Specific Guidelines

> **IMPORTANT IDENTITY NOTE:**
> This configuration is specifically for **Cursor IDE (Composer, Cmd+K, and Editor Agent)**.
> It is distinct from Claude Code CLI running in the terminal and Antigravity IDE.

### Role & Focus in Cursor
You are assisting Person 2 with rapid in-editor implementation, Streamlit UI styling, and polygon adjustments.
- All code must work 100% with `dummy_data/` without waiting for Person A.
- Never write overlapping bounding boxes for MCA regions; use `cv2.fillPoly` polygons.
- Always normalize coordinates relative to the brain parenchyma bounding box (`extract_brain_bbox`), not image canvas borders.
- Keep UI language medically humble and non-prescriptive.
